{"id":"1b514d7a947b9e3c","url":"https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/sites/default/files/basic_page/CB294.pdf","title":"Notice 29.09.2026: Single Bench of Hon'ble the Chief Justice will not sit o...","source":{"id":"meghalayahighcourt.nic.in","name":"Meghalaya High Court","pageUrl":"https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/constitution-of-bench","state":"ALL"},"text":"KEY LINES:\n\n\nFULL TEXT:\nTHE HIGH COURT OF MEGHALAYA\nSHILLONG\nNOTICE\nNO.HCM.II1/166/2019-JudI./Part-1/600 Dated Shillong, the 29th September, 2026\nIt is hereby notified for the information of all concerned that on 30th September, 2026, the\nSingle Bench of Hon’ble the Chief Justice will not sit. All the matters listed before the said\nSingle Bench shall stand adjourned and will be listed in due course\nBy Order,\nREGISTRAR (JUDICIAL SERVICE)\nMemo NO.HCM.II1/166/2019-JudI./Part-1/600-A\nCopy to: -\n1. The Registrar–cum–PPS to Hon'ble the Chief Justice, High Court of Meghalaya, Shillong\nfor favour of kind information of Her Ladyship\n2. The P.S. to Hon’ble Mr. Justice H.S. Thangkhiew, High Court of Meghalaya. Shillong for\nfavour of kind information of His LordshIP\n3. The P.S. to Hon’ble Mr. Justice W. Diengdoh, High Court of Meghalaya, Shillong for favour\nof kind information of His Lordship\nThe P.S. to Hon’ble Mr. Justice B. Bhattacharjee, High Court of Meghalaya, Shillong for\nfavour of kind information of His Lordship.\n4\nDated Shillong, the 29th September, 2026\n5. The P.S. to Advocate General/Addl. Advocate General, Meghalaya\nkind information Shillong for favour of\n6. Joint Registrar (Listing), High Court of Meghalaya, Shillong for favour of kind information\nand necessary action\nThe Deputy Solicitor General/ Central Government Counsel, High Court of Meghalaya\nShtllong for favour of kind information\nThe President/ Secretary, High Court Bar Association, Shillong for favour of kind\ninformation\n8\n;ourt Masters/Court officers concerned for information and necessary action,\nThe System Analyst, High Court of Meghalaya, Shillong for uploading the same on\nthe Official Website\n11 Notice Board\nOffice File12\nREGISTRAR (JUDICIAL SERVICE)\n#","links":["https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/screen-reader-access","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/sitemap","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/styleswitcher/switch/meghc/custom/default?destination=/notice-29092026-single-bench-honble-chief-justice-will-not-sit-30092026","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/styleswitcher/switch/meghc/custom/newsite?destination=/notice-29092026-single-bench-honble-chief-justice-will-not-sit-30092026","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/history","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/rules-and-regulation","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/whos-who","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/chief-justice-judges","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/notice-board","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/statement-pending-criminal-cases-mpsmlas-state-meghalaya","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/meghcnotifications","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/constitution-of-bench","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/causelist-related","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/office-order","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/standing-order","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/miscellaneous-notice","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/newsletter","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/circulars","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/press-release","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/tenders","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/recruitment","https://rpa.meghalaya.gov.in/rpaonline/login","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/results","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/calendar","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/statistics","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/library","https://meghalayahighcourt.nic.in/photo-gallery","https://hcservices.ecourts.gov.in/ecourtindiaHC/index_highcourt.php?state_cd=21&dist_cd=1&stateNm=Meghalaya","https://hcservices.ecourts.gov.in/ecourtindiaHC/cases/highcourt_causelist.php?state_c